tion, the associations that bind observations to one another, and the slow rhythms by which those associations change."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"From this perspective, intelligence is less about gathering and more about listening — to the structure that already exists between things, and to the way that structure breathes."}]]}],["$","$L3",null,{"delay":0.2,"className":"mt-16 border-l-2 border-ink-deep pl-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl font-light italic leading-snug text-ink-deep","children":"Contextual awareness is not a feature. It is a stance."}]}],["$","$L3",null,{"delay":0.25,"className":"mt-16 space-y-6 font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-ink","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"URG-IS is presented here as a conceptual framework — a way of framing inquiry rather than a system to be operated. Its purpose is to clarify what becomes thinkable when relationships, rather than records, are placed at the centre of attention."}]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","footer",null,{"className":"mt-32 border-t hairline","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-6 py-16 lg:px-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"md:col-span-5","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/","className":"flex items-baseline gap-2 font-display","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-2xl tracking-tight text-ink-deep","children":"URG"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-ink-deep"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-2xl tracking-tight text-ink-deep","children":"IS"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-md font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-mute","children":"A conceptual framework for relationship-awareness and contextual understanding across evolving environments."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"md:col-span-4 md:col-start-7","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"label-eyebrow mb-4","children":"Navigate"}],["$","ul",null,{